# AWS Data Pipeline Project — Amazon Products Analysis

## Project Overview
End-to-end data pipeline built on AWS for analyzing Amazon product data.

## Architecture
S3 → Glue Crawler → Glue ETL → Athena → QuickSight

## Tech Stack
- Amazon S3 (data storage)
- AWS Glue (ETL & cataloging)
- Amazon Athena (SQL queries)
- Amazon QuickSight (visualization)
- Dataset: Amazon Products (Kaggle)

## Steps
1. Uploaded raw CSV to S3
2. Created Glue Crawler to catalog data
3. Ran Glue ETL job for transformation
4. Queried data using Athena
5. Built interactive dashboard in QuickSight

